close_reason: "Merged in #136 (691724c). The local reader now uses the public SDK listAllComplete + certifyCompleteListResult and refuses incomplete or malformed answers before provider access or writes. Orchestrator verification: reader-only behavioural revert fails 4 of 54 complete-read tests (>10,000 export, malformed tracker, terminal matching + idempotent re-import for atomic on/off); npm+Bun release:check pass (276 tests); CodeRabbit full review: no findings."
body: ""
